'.\" -*- nroff -*-
.TH KAFS-V6 8 "2026-07-20" "kafs 0.4.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
kafs-v6 \- retired format v6 runtime placeholder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kafs-v6
.RB [ --help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kafs-v6
is a temporary fail-closed placeholder for the retired format v6 runtime.
Operational requests exit without opening or mounting an image. Use offline
tools while migrating remaining experimental v6 images, or recreate them as
format v7 images for use with
.BR kafs-v7 (8).
.PP
The placeholder command will be removed after the remaining v6 offline and
layout sources have been retired.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Show the retirement notice and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Help was printed.
.TP
.B 2
An operational request was rejected because v6 runtime support is retired.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kafs (1),
.BR kafs-v7 (8),
.BR fsck.kafs (8),
.BR kafsdump (8)
.SH AUTHOR
kafs project.
